From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:38:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 207/210] codecs: Add AVS2 stateless decoder base class

Add GstAvs2Decoder, a base class for stateless AVS2 (GB/T 33475.2)
decoders, with GstAvs2Picture.

It takes one coded picture per buffer, as avs2parse outputs them, and
manages the decoded picture buffer as section 9.2 of the standard
describes it: decode_order_index is unwrapped, the picture order count
is derived from it and picture_output_delay (a GB picture keeps the
delay of the previous picture), the references are taken from the
reference configuration set of each picture by their decode order
index, with the background picture for S pictures and for P and F
pictures with background_reference, and pictures are marked unused as
the configuration sets remove them or when they are 128 pictures or
more away. The subclass gets the references in configuration set
order, with the picture order counts of their own references, as the
AVS2 uAPI takes them. Pictures are output in picture order count order,
delayed by the picture_reorder_delay of the sequence and at once at a
sequence end. Pictures before the first intra picture whose references
are missing are dropped. Field coded sequences are refused.

Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 gst-libs/gst/codecs/gstavs2decoder.c | 775 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 gst-libs/gst/codecs/gstavs2decoder.h | 164 ++++++
 gst-libs/gst/codecs/gstavs2picture.c |  55 ++
 gst-libs/gst/codecs/gstavs2picture.h | 133 +++++
 gst-libs/gst/codecs/meson.build      |   4 +
 5 files changed, 1131 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 gst-libs/gst/codecs/gstavs2decoder.c
 create mode 100644 gst-libs/gst/codecs/gstavs2decoder.h
 create mode 100644 gst-libs/gst/codecs/gstavs2picture.c
 create mode 100644 gst-libs/gst/codecs/gstavs2picture.h

diff --git a/gst-libs/gst/codecs/gstavs2decoder.c b/gst-libs/gst/codecs/gstavs2decoder.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..be3e577
--- /dev/null
+++ b/gst-libs/gst/codecs/gstavs2decoder.c
@@ -0,0 +1,775 @@
